{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux短时间内大量结束进程。对应需求：影响破坏。官方：High Number of Process Terminations。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.*","endgame-*","auditbeat-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux短时间内大量结束进程","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux短时间内大量结束进程\n\n### 为何重要\n破坏可用性或加密数据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":47,"rule_id":"67f8443a-4ff3-4a70-916d-3cfa3ae9f02b","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 影响破坏","来源: 默认","对应需求: 影响破坏"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"threshold","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:linux and event.type:start and (\n  (process.name:\"pkill\" and process.args:\"-f\") or\n  (process.name:kill and process.args:\"-9\") or\n  (process.name:killall)\n)\n","threshold":{"field":["host.id","process.executable","user.name"],"value":15},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1489","name":"Service Stop","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1489/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0040","name":"Impact","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0040/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1562","name":"Impair Defenses","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1562.001","name":"Disable or Modify Tools","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":119,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
